"""Romanian / English for the whole app. The app is written in English; when Romanian is chosen (Settings), every
text shown on screen goes through T(): exact texts from EXACT, messages with values through TEMPLATES (the values are
kept, words inside them translated too), HTML text piece by piece. Hooks on the Qt setters / painters and a sweep of
every window when it is shown do it everywhere, so the app's code and logic stay untouched.
Texts used as VALUES (sequence settings, output software, camera roles) are deliberately not in the dictionary.
"""
